  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Hatchling Toxic Marked wasn't always so…marked. Born in the shadow of the Bldg Last Call Cantina, a toxic spill during a DRIP raid left him changed, forever haunted by visions of blood spattered on his beloved Ghost Reddy shirt. Now, fueled by vengeance and the strange resilience granted by the toxins, he scours Subchain City for the responsible party.",
    "class": "Vigilante",
    "name": "Marked Reddy",
    "personality": "Grim and brooding, Marked Reddy is a duck of few words, preferring to let his actions speak louder than his Dust Sniffer beak. He possesses a dark sense of humor, often making morbid jokes to diffuse tense situations. Secretly, he cares deeply for the other members of his flock, though he would never admit it.",
